        -:    1://///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
        -:    2:// Name:        wx/ffile.h
        -:    3:// Purpose:     wxFFile - encapsulates "FILE *" stream
        -:    4:// Author:      Vadim Zeitlin
        -:    5:// Modified by:
        -:    6:// Created:     14.07.99
        -:    7:// Copyright:   (c) 1998 Vadim Zeitlin <zeitlin@dptmaths.ens-cachan.fr>
